{"action_id":null,"arguments":[],"assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"node.80b94d5df59c55e50b547434.a0","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The assessment concerns one offered benefit in a distributor’s promotion of SFC-authorised funds.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.80b94d5df59c55e50b547434.a1","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"A genuine discount can be treated as excepted even where it otherwise falls within the assessed gift category.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.80b94d5df59c55e50b547434.a2","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The unqualified words 'fees or charges' do not require those fees to relate to the promoted product.","status":"PROVISIONAL"}],"bundle_hash":"3fa8c449383de5ee8aa6303aa80aee55009d0ef85a335cea03e270f22874fd26","candidate_id":"candidate.8aec15decfd64981833bb9e20562a266","controlled_language":"Selected control: paragraph-10 gift-promotion restriction, with an unqualified fee-discount exception. Within scope, an offered gift is caught unless it is a genuine discount of fees or charges. A true result identifies an offer caught by this selected restriction only.","disposition_reason":"Unreviewed interpretation proposal","family_ids":["exceptions"],"generation_phase":"BLIND_INITIAL","issue_ids":[],"parent_id":null,"probability_of_legal_correctness":null,"revision_reason":"On this textual reading, a genuine discount on another service’s fees can fall within the exception even when used to promote a fund. This gives the unqualified exception broader reach than the product-related reading.","run_id":"run.d6106e5450c749a58852e36e6f81a6e0","scheduling_priority":0,"schema_version":"interpretation.v1","score_purpose":"INVESTIGATION_PRIORITY_ONLY","source_packet_hash":"7b78bffd5267abb04c58ab204d1e34f621dc3fb03008be1b35980abcaa535ba4","source_unit_ids":["u1","u13","u14"],"status":"ACTIVE","subject_unit":"Breadth of the fee-discount exception"}